      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but i don't think people \"help\" in situations like this. they just want you to get back to normal so they don't have to feel uncomfortable anymore. the truth is, the world is just broken. i tried to fix one small thing and it cost me my entire existence. i look at my life and there's just nothing there anymore. it's like i'm already a ghost.",
